        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 7635, Dummy Stonebriar Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in oil rubbed bronze or matte black finishes this Weslock Stonebriar Dummy Handleset features a beveled edge mounting plate. The handle has an elegant curve that will add a timeless beauty to any home. A dummy handleset, it is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function. It does not lock or latch. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/stonebriar-single-cylinder-handleset-weslock-7631-7600\"><b>Stonebriar Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditionally styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\"><b>Weslock Molten Bronze Collection</b></a> which features easy installation as well as lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Stonebriar Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid molten bronze.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Molten Bronze Collection Stonebriar Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection:  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
